# NeetCode Debug Overlay — no secrets live in this file.
#
# Your Claude API key is stored securely in chrome.storage.sync (encrypted
# by Chrome and synced to your Google account — never written to disk here).
#
# To set your key:
#   1. Load the extension in Chrome (chrome://extensions > Load unpacked)
#   2. Click the extension icon in the toolbar
#   3. Paste your Anthropic API key (sk-ant-...) and click Save
#
# Get a key at: https://console.anthropic.com/
